<title>UK: UK Nov oil output up 0.07 to 2.71 mln bpd - WoodMa.</title>
<headline>UK Nov oil output up 0.07 to 2.71 mln bpd - WoodMa.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.K. oil production in November rose to its highest level since November 1995, totalling 2.71 million barrels per day (bpd), consultants Wood Mackenzie said on Monday.</p>
<p>This corresponds to an increase of 69,000 bpd on the previous month's figure. For comparison, the November 1995 output was only marginally higher at 2.72 million bpd.</p>
